  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "La Alhambra con regla y compás: el trazado de los diseños geométricos nazaríes (ALZADA 115, 2017)",
      "creator": "Manuel Martínez Vela",
      "url": "https://www.riarte.es/handle/20.500.12251/633",
      "note": "The grid-and-diagonals base and the tracing of the plaster panel (yesería) of the Torre de las Infantas follow this article.",
      "steps": [
        1,
        2,
        3,
        4,
        5,
        6
      ],
      "kind": "drawing"
    }
  ],
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of one cross.",
    "A": "Any point to the right of O. The distance OA is one square of the grid."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through the centre and draw a small circle. Its radius is one square of the grid, and the compass keeps this opening for the whole construction.",
      "create": {"h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}, "c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Walk the compass along the horizontal: put the point where the circle crosses the line and mark the next crossing, again and again, both ways. The marks are one square apart.",
      "create": {
        "Xm1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180}}},
        "cx1": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "X2": {"point": {"meet": ["cx1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cxm1": {"circle": {"centre": "Xm1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Xm2": {"point": {"meet": ["cxm1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cx2": {"circle": {"centre": "X2", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "X3": {"point": {"meet": ["cx2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cxm2": {"circle": {"centre": "Xm2", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Xm3": {"point": {"meet": ["cxm2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through the centre, at right angles to the horizontal, and walk the compass up and down it in the same way.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Y1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90}}},
        "Ym1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270}}},
        "cy1": {"circle": {"centre": "Y1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Y2": {"point": {"meet": ["cy1", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cym1": {"circle": {"centre": "Ym1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Ym2": {"point": {"meet": ["cym1", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cy2": {"circle": {"centre": "Y2", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Y3": {"point": {"meet": ["cy2", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cym2": {"circle": {"centre": "Ym2", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Ym3": {"point": {"meet": ["cym2", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["h"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Through every mark rule a line at right angles to its axis. The lines make a square grid.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Through the first two marks on each side of the centre, rule a line at right angles to its axis. The lines make a square grid.",
      "create": {
        "Vm3": {"line": {"through": "Xm3", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Hm3": {"line": {"through": "Ym3", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "Vm2": {"line": {"through": "Xm2", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Hm2": {"line": {"through": "Ym2", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "Vm1": {"line": {"through": "Xm1", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Hm1": {"line": {"through": "Ym1", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "V1": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "H1": {"line": {"through": "Y1", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "V2": {"line": {"through": "X2", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "H2": {"line": {"through": "Y2", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "V3": {"line": {"through": "X3", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "H3": {"line": {"through": "Y3", "perpendicularTo": "v"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["h", "v"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Halve the right angles at the centre to get the two diagonals, and rule lines parallel to them through every mark on the horizontal. Every square of the grid now has both its diagonals.",
      "create": {
        "d1": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "Y1"]}},
        "d2": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["Y1", "O", "Xm1"]}},
        "Dmm3": {"line": {"through": "Xm3", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dpm3": {"line": {"through": "Xm3", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Dmm2": {"line": {"through": "Xm2", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dpm2": {"line": {"through": "Xm2", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Dmm1": {"line": {"through": "Xm1", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dpm1": {"line": {"through": "Xm1", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Dm1": {"line": {"through": "A", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dp1": {"line": {"through": "A", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Dm2": {"line": {"through": "X2", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dp2": {"line": {"through": "X2", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Dm3": {"line": {"through": "X3", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Dp3": {"line": {"through": "X3", "parallelTo": "d2"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["h", "v"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Mark the tile: the square, standing on a corner, whose corners are three squares from the centre along the horizontal and the vertical. Some lines of this design end at the centre of a square, where its two diagonals cross; mark those crossings too.",
      "create": {
        "Gm3_0": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm3", "h"]}},
        "Gm5h_m1h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dmm2", "Dpm3"]}},
        "Gm5h_1h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dmm3", "Dpm2"]}},
        "Gm2_m1": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "Hm1"]}},
        "Gm2_0": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "h"]}},
        "Gm2_1": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "H1"]}},
        "Gm3h_m3h": {"point": {"meet": ["d1", "Dpm3"]}},
        "Gm3h_3h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dmm3", "d2"]}},
        "Gm1_m2": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "Hm2"]}},
        "Gm1_m1": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "Hm1"]}},
        "Gm1_0": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "h"]}},
        "Gm1_1": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "H1"]}},
        "Gm1_2": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "H2"]}},
        "Gm1h_m5h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dm2", "Dpm3"]}},
        "Gm1h_m1h": {"point": {"meet": ["d1", "Dpm1"]}},
        "Gm1h_1h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dmm1", "d2"]}},
        "Gm1h_5h": {"point": {"meet": ["Dmm3", "Dp2"]}},
        "G0_m3": {"point": {"meet": ["v", "Hm3"]}},
        "G0_m2": {"point": {"meet": ["v", "Hm2"]}},
